The '''House of Neliko''' ([[IPA]]: /nɛliko/; [[Qymish language|Qymish]]: Ⱄⰺⰿⱒⰰ ⰹⱋ Ⱀⰵⰾⰹⰽⱁ, ''Symqa ish Neliko'') was a noble [[wikipedia:dynasty|dynasty]] of [[Qym]]. The Nelikos ruled the [[Duchy of Qym]] from its creation in {{abbr|1100|914 (Earth Year Equivalent)}} until its elevation to a [[Principality of Qym|principality]] in {{abbr|1453|1207 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}, and from then until the extinction of the line in {{abbr|1564|1299 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}, whereafter they were succeeded by the [[House of Zhifol]]. 

